  {
    "insert": "The exposé should contain specific research questions of appropriate scope, and a methodology that addresses these questions. The proposal identifies a critical research gap, but does not define the scope and focus of the thesis. The research questions (with potential sub questions) should be clearly stated in the motivation."
  },
